+// TEST-ONLY (tools/genome/test-switches.patch, never committed): synthetic input from Gyro4All.ini, read on every save:
+// GenomeTestYaw / GenomeTestPitch (millidegrees a frame), GenomeTestStickX (right stick X), GenomeForceNoCamera=1 (the
